    <description>A late support belt: capacity +15%, elasticity +30%, digestion +25%, and 10% less fullness movement penalty. Its weight and belt slot are significant tradeoffs. Children can wear it for native clothing protection; metabolic bonuses apply only to eligible adults.</description>
    <modExtensions>
